# CLARIO-V2

> **Adaptive Multi-Agent AI Learning Platform**

CLARIO provides an adaptive learning experience tailored to what the learner needs next. It replaces generic AI chatbot responses with a coordinated multi-agent system.

---

## Architecture Overview

```mermaid
flowchart TD
    Learner[Learner] --> Frontend[Frontend UX Companions]
    Frontend --> NOVA[NOVA Central Orchestrator]
    NOVA --> Research[Research Agent]
    NOVA --> Teaching[Teaching Agent]
    NOVA --> Thinking[Critical Thinking Agent]
    NOVA --> Practical[Practical Agent]
    NOVA --> Quiz[Quiz Agent]
    NOVA --> Ellara[Evaluation Agent / Ellara]
    Ellara --> NOVA
    NOVA --> DB[(SQLite Database)]
```

